# Wanted (IDEAS I19, I25 a; QUESTIONS Q22 and Q29, 7; board 0.8). Fails until it is answered; then it moves up into collab/scenarios.
# Story: after Arrange Windows a person double-clicks a title bar, and macOS makes the window fill the screen. It stays so: through time,
# through a switch to another window and back, and through a neighbour that closes. The second double-click takes it back.
# `double-click <id>` is the chaos script's word; the plain simulator has to learn it.
open Safari
open Notes
open Mail
arrange
double-click 102
expect ok
expect still
expect size 102 1440x875
wait 5
expect size 102 1440x875
focus 101
focus 102
expect size 102 1440x875
close 103
expect size 102 1440x875
double-click 102
expect docked 102
